      "id": "jiolcrd",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "2. Prehistoric Period of India"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "wqh0reb",
      "content": "The prehistoric period refers to the time before the invention of writing. It is known mainly through tools, cave paintings, and fossils."
    },
    {
      "id": "laxkn01",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Period</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Features</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Important Sites</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Paleolithic Age (Old Stone Age)</p>",
            "<p>Use of crude stone tools, hunting and food gathering</p>",
            "<p>Bhimbetka, Hunsgi</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Mesolithic Age (Middle Stone Age)</p>",
            "<p>Microlith tools, beginning of domestication</p>",
            "<p>Bagor, Adamgarh</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Neolithic Age (New Stone Age)</p>",
            "<p>Polished stone tools, agriculture begins</p>",
            "<p>Mehrgarh, Burzahom</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f5o2192",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. Indus Valley Civilization (Harappan Civilization)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "za3bc1n",
      "content": "Time Period: Approximately 2500 BCE – 1750 BCE"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ch3e0eh",
      "content": "The Indus Valley Civilization was one of the world's earliest urban civilizations. It developed mainly along the Indus River and its tributaries."
    },
    {
      "id": "7dcz02r",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Major Features"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "i7r8q1u",
      "content": "• Well-planned cities with grid pattern"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "roo7cp4",
      "content": "• Advanced drainage system                                                        "
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "8in5xa9",
      "content": "• Use of standardized bricks"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "4x6zs4h",
      "content": "• Trade with Mesopotamia"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tqwvqs6",
      "content": "• Use of seals and undeciphered script"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "81fmfj3",
      "content": "• Absence of large temples or palaces"
    },
    {
