      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Iron was COMPLETELY UNKNOWN to the people of the Indus Valley Civilization; copper and bronze were the primary metals used.",
        "Lothal is frequently tested as the world's earliest known artificial brick dockyard and a prominent trade port.",
        "Evidence of a ploughed field and fire altars was discovered at Kalibangan in Rajasthan.",
        "The Pashupati Seal from Mohenjo-daro depicts a seated figure surrounded by five animals: elephant, tiger, rhino, buffalo, and two deer at his feet."
      ],
      "id": "mtkv895"
